  "disclaimer": "*This % may represent an aggregate of THC/CBD, THCa/CBDa, THCb/CBDb within the product. Consumers should review the actual product label for exact % of THC/CBD.",
  "description": "The Fresh Connection presents Mucho Melon, a 1g pre-roll that delivers a refreshingly fruity cannabis experience. This premium preroll showcases sweet melon flavors with tropical undertones, creating a smooth and enjoyable smoke from start to finish. The Fresh Connection is known for crafting high-quality, convenient pre-rolls using carefully selected flower, and Mucho Melon is no exception. Each 1g preroll is expertly rolled for an even burn, making it perfect for on-the-go enjoyment or sharing with friends. The mouthwatering melon profile offers a deliciously sweet aroma that transitions into a flavorful, satisfying smoke. Whether you're new to cannabis or a seasoned enthusiast, this pre-roll provides a hassle-free way to enjoy quality flower without the need for grinding or rolling. Grab Mucho Melon for a tasty, portable cannabis experience that captures the essence of fresh, ripe melon in every puff.",
